# Committed on purpose: the API origin is public (the browser calls it), not a
# secret. Vite loads this automatically during `vite build`, so the GitHub
# Pages deploy needs no extra configuration.
#
# This matches the Render service name in /render.yaml
# (kim-and-kayzee-api). If you rename the Render service, update this too.
VITE_API_URL=https://kim-and-kayzee-api.onrender.com
